// Draupnir — Generators and Combinators
// DWARF-119: The generator / combinator surface used to build property
// arguments for `for_all`.
//
// Base generators (`int`, `nat`, `float`, `string`, `bool`) and generator
// combinators (`list`, `option`, `result`, `one_of`, `refine`, `map`)
// compose into the values handed to a property by `for_all`.
//
// NOTE: Function-level generics are not yet supported by the parser, so
// generator values and callbacks use the most permissive concrete types
// that the current compiler accepts.

